{
  "module": "liquidity score (cold start and measured)",
  "source": "docs/automations.md.txt §4; docs/ai-integration.md.txt §9; docs/architecture.md §20",
  "rule": "Fewer than 3 measured sales: score = tier score (high 80, medium 65, low 45) − liq_review_penalty × day-45 returns. 3 or more: the documented weighted formula with each component capped to 0–100 (automations.md.txt §4). The final score is clamped to 0–100.",
  "cases": [
